abstract: >-
  ClinTAB-ML is a local web application for developing and evaluating clinical
  prediction models on tabular registry data. It covers data profiling, model
  training with leakage-free validation, calibration, restricted cubic splines,
  survival analysis and the usual epidemiological calculators, and it builds a
  methods paragraph and a TRIPOD+AI coverage report from a log of the analysis.
  All processing stays on the researcher's computer.
keywords:
